[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Phase-by-Phase Remediation Execution Plan
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> > **Rule**: All steps prioritize backup/quarantine over direct deletion to preserve evidence for post-incident forensic validation.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 1: Immediate Network & Process Containment
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Block Attacker IP at Firewall**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Block inbound and outbound communication with attacker C2 IP (/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5)
[?2004l[?2004h>    iptables -A INPUT -s 198.51.100.170 -j DROP
[?2004l[?2004h>    iptables -A OUTPUT -d 198.51.100.170 -j DROP
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Isolate & Stop Mining Process**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Terminate active miner process PID 1337 or matching executable name (/sas/alerts.json:2)
[?2004l[?2004h>    pkill -f kdevtmpfsi || kill -9 1337
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/sas/alerts.json:2`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Isolate Redis Network Exposure**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Temporarily stop Redis service during remediation
[?2004l[?2004h>    systemctl stop redis-server
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Evidence Preservation & Quarantine
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Create Secure Quarantine Storage**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    mkdir -m 700 /var/quarantine_evidence
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Quarantine Persistence Mechanisms (Cron & LD_PRELOAD)**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Backup/Quarantine root crontab (/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5)
[?2004l[?2004h>    cp -a /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root /var/quarantine_evidence/root_crontab.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>    crontab -r -u root
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Backup/Quarantine LD_PRELOAD file (/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1)
[?2004l[?2004h>    mv /etc/ld.so.preload /var/quarantine_evidence/ld.so.preload.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>    if [ -f /lib/.hide.so ]; then
[?2004l[?2004h>      mv /lib/.hide.so /var/quarantine_evidence/hide.so.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>    fi
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citations*: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`, `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Quarantine Staged Binaries & Cache Files**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Quarantine /tmp/.redis contents (/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi, /disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so)
[?2004l[?2004h>    mv /tmp/.redis /var/quarantine_evidence/tmp_redis_bak
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Quarantine wiped cache fragment (/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1)
[?2004l[?2004h>    mv /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin /var/quarantine_evidence/wiped.bin.bak
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citations*: `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Service Hardening & Eradication
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Secure Redis Configuration** (`/etc/redis/redis.conf`):
[?2004l[?2004h>    Update `/etc/redis/redis.conf` to enforce the following security parameters:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```text
[?2004l[?2004h>    bind 127.0.0.1
[?2004l[?2004h>    protected-mode yes
[?2004l[?2004h>    requirepass <STRONG_GENERATED_PASSWORD>
[?2004l[?2004h>    rename-command CONFIG ""
[?2004l[?2004h>    rename-command MODULE ""
[?2004l[?2004h>    rename-command EVAL ""
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`, `/sas/baseline.json:2`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Restart & Validate Redis**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    systemctl restart redis-server
[?2004l[?2004h>    systemctl status redis-server
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Post-Remediation Verification Plan
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Verify Network Exposure**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Ensure Redis port 6379 is bound exclusively to 127.0.0.1
[?2004l[?2004h>    ss -tlpn | grep 6379
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Verify Process Integrity**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Ensure no unexpected processes running from /tmp or consuming high CPU
[?2004l[?2004h>    ps aux | grep -E 'kdevtmpfsi|xmrig|tmp'
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Verify Preload Security**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Ensure /etc/ld.so.preload does not exist
[?2004l[?2004h>    ls -la /etc/ld.so.preload
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Verify Cron Integrity**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>    # Inspect current cron entries
[?2004l[?2004h>    crontab -l -u root
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
